Usage: agent-deck remote add <name> <user@host> [options]
       agent-deck remote add --provider <name> [--name <remote>]

Options:
  --agent-deck-path string
        Path to agent-deck on the remote (default: agent-deck)
  --profile string
        Remote profile to use (default: default)
  --provider string
        Create a sandbox with this [providers.<name>] and register it (no <user@host>)
  --name string
        With --provider: remote name (default: <provider>-<random suffix>)
